 "remarks": "Sophisticated condo home tucked away in a private setting but close to shopping, dining and the train station. Located on the upper level this home has an inviting entrance, split vestibule with access to oversized one car garage, mudroom with a built-in bench, large storage room and a coat closet. Enter the large living room through a charming french door where you will find a bright and inviting space with vaulted ceiling, wood burning fireplace,bay window and patio door to a newer deck. The kitchen is large with high quality cabinets, granite counters, under-mounted sink, LG appliances and under cabinet lighting. The dining area is the perfect size for dinner parties, with a double hung window for air and natural light and flows perfectly with the kitchen and living room. The primary bedroom is large with big windows, a gorgeous attached bath with a walk-in tiled shower, jacuzzi tub and a generous walk-in closet with built-ins. There is a remodeled powder room with laundry. There is bamboo flooring, custom window blinds, lovely light fixtures and a loft overlooking the living room all adding to the charm and comfort of this home. This HOA is highly sought after for its classic architectural design,manicured gardens ,tons of visitor parking and quiet lifestyle close to the city. An outdoor pool and clubhouse just outside the gate house add to the luxurious feeling you get upon entering the property.",
